    <p>Real ranges:</p>
    <ul class="trades-list-block">
      <li><strong>Torsion spring replacement</strong> — about $150 to $350 installed, usually same day, done in pairs.</li>
      <li><strong>New opener installed</strong> — roughly $350 to $600 depending on drive type and features.</li>
